summary: 'Shipped all 5 phases of Maestro team collaboration in a single session: visible orchestration with attributed agent responses, Conductor Swift views (TeamThreadView, AgentRosterView, SymphonyThreadWatcher), agent bench/activate system, Platform web Team dashboard, and Neverland validation metrics. Then field-tested on deus-backend, diagnosed the learning quality gap (generic briefs, flat scoring, self-silencing loop), and designed+implemented the Teacher Model — session work log, Maestro postflight learning pass, documentor agent, stale nomination expiry, and orchestration guidance rewrite.'
